{"unit_id": "tag:01WB:proof", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>可知，（2）蕴含（1）。假设（1）成立。\n对每个点（point）<MATH_0001>，都能找到<MATH_0002>，它是<MATH_0003>的一个仿射开（affine open）邻域（neighbourhood），使得<MATH_0004>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0005>的一个闭子概形（closed subscheme），其中用到某个有限型（finite type）的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），它是<MATH_0006>-模（modules）层<MATH_0007>。\n将该层写成<MATH_0008>，其中取某个有限型（finite type）的<MATH_0009>-模（module）<MATH_0010>（见 Properties 章的引理<REF_0002>）。\n选取生成元（generators）<MATH_0011>，用以生成<MATH_0012>这个<MATH_0013>-模（module）。\n考虑满射（surjective）的分次（graded）<MATH_0014>-代数映射（algebra map）\n<MATH_0015>\n根据 Constructions 章的引理<REF_0003>，相应的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0016>\n是闭浸入（closed immersion）。因此，<MATH_0017>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0018>的一个闭子概形（closed subscheme）（作为<MATH_0019>上的概形（scheme））。\n换言之，（2）成立。\n", "allowed_english": ["Properties", "Constructions"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "generators", "target_term": "生成元"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "逐点选取开邻域时的量化对象。"}, {"source_ter